---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Pricing | Podomy"
	description="Podomy commercial licenses start at $10,000 USD per year. Enterprise deployments are quoted individually. SLAs and support are priced separately."
	currentPath="/pricing/"
>
	<h1 class="page-title">Pricing</h1>
	<p class="page-lead" style="font-weight: 400;">
		Clear numbers. No sales maze.
	</p>

	<section class="content-section" style="margin-top: 0;">
		<p class="body-p">
			<strong>Open source: $0.</strong> AGPLv3. Free when your code stays open.
		</p>
		<p class="body-p">
			<strong>Commercial: from $10,000/year.</strong> For companies under $1M/year. Proprietary code is fine. Startups welcome.
		</p>
		<p class="body-p">
			<strong>Enterprise: custom.</strong> For companies over $1M/year. Based on machine count, warranty, indemnity, and SLAs.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="content-section">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2 class="section-title">Try it first</h2>
		</div>
		<p class="body-p">
			One binary. Two nodes. Cut the network.
		</p>
		<p class="body-p">
			<a href="/docs/deployment/" class="body-link">Deployment guide</a>
		</p>
	</section>

	<p class="body-p">
		Support and SLAs are separate.
	</p>
	<p class="body-p">
		<a href="/contact/" class="body-link">Contact engineering</a>
	</p>
</Layout>
